  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a12232814247897b",
      "translationZh": "BigCode 正在发布 StarCoder2，这是新一代训练过程透明的开放代码大语言模型。所有 StarCoder2 变体均在 The Stack v2 上训练，这是一个全新的大规模高质量代码数据集。我们发布了所有模型、数据集，以及数据处理代码和训练代码。详情请参阅论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d94f6683ea7ecee6",
      "translationZh": "什么是 StarCoder2？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db019d24ef8a3f02",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2 是一个面向代码的开放大语言模型系列，提供 3 种不同规模，参数量分别为 3B、7B 和 15B。旗舰模型 StarCoder2-15B 使用来自 The Stack v2 的超过 4 万亿个词元和 600+ 种编程语言进行训练。所有模型均采用分组查询注意力，上下文窗口为 16,384 个词元，滑动窗口注意力的窗口大小为 4,096 个词元，并使用中间填充目标进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb8dd4e62cdb8e97",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2 提供三种模型规模：由 ServiceNow 训练的 30 亿参数模型、由 Hugging Face 训练的 70 亿参数模型，以及由 NVIDIA 在 NVIDIA 加速基础设施上使用 NVIDIA NeMo 训练的 150 亿参数模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ffbe13374375ae0",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2-3B 使用来自 The Stack v2 的 17 种编程语言、3+ 万亿个词元进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59685926da8c0d6f",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2-7B 使用来自 The Stack v2 的 17 种编程语言、3.5+ 万亿个词元进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6aceca4d014c6b4",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2-15B 使用来自 The Stack v2 的 600+ 种编程语言、4+ 万亿个词元进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3287502150f092ac",
      "translationZh": "StarCoder2-15B 在同等规模的模型中表现最佳，并在许多评估中达到与 33B+ 模型相当的表现。StarCoder2-3B 的性能与 StarCoder1-15B 相当：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e31f4d2ea197283",
      "translationZh": "什么是 The Stack v2？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25c48e8a9b8c1e62",
      "translationZh": "The Stack v2 是适合 LLM 预训练的最大开放代码数据集。The Stack v2 比 The Stack v1 更大，采用了改进的语言和许可证检测流程，以及更好的启发式过滤方法。此外，训练数据集按代码仓库分组，从而可以利用代码仓库上下文训练模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a18b869b2e81c0c5",
      "translationZh": "完整",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb60c16478a264b1",
      "translationZh": "已去重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83f13ddc9fcee68f",
      "translationZh": "训练数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d97273da0e4ffdc",
      "translationZh": "~200B 词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
