      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aad8455754cbf0cb",
      "translationZh": "该数据集源自 Software Heritage 档案库，这是最大的软件源代码及其配套开发历史的公共档案库。Software Heritage 由 Inria 与 UNESCO 合作发起，是一项开放的非营利倡议，旨在收集、保存和共享所有公开可用软件的源代码。我们感谢 Software Heritage 提供对这一宝贵资源的访问权限。更多详情，请访问 Software Heritage 网站。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2601a0dddf9e42b",
      "translationZh": "可通过 Hugging Face Hub 访问 The Stack v2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1453b54b7a6bc24",
      "translationZh": "关于 BigCode",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "234a558967f6e3a5",
      "translationZh": "BigCode 是由 Hugging Face 和 ServiceNow 共同领导的一项开放科学协作计划，致力于以负责任的方式开发面向代码的大语言模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
